Time-Keeper-Zone

The time zones of the IANA database, compiled in, for Time::Keeper.

INSTALLATION

    perl Makefile.PL
    make
    make test
    make install

The tools/ directory holds tzcompile, the script that turns the IANA
time zone database into the tables this dist ships, with zic from the
same IANA release. It is not installed and is not needed to build or
install the dist: its output is part of the dist.

